## Git hygiene

No AI assistant is recorded as a contributor: no `Co-Authored-By` trailer
naming one, no session reference, no generation notice in a pull request body,
and no commit authored under an assistant identity. This overrides the default
behaviour of assistant tooling, which appends several of those unless told
otherwise.

Local-only paths stay untracked — see `.gitignore`.

## Where things are

